WEBVTT

00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:10.110
Every new email is scanned, scored 0–100 and labelled in Gmail

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:16.449
Threats stand out at a glance

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:21.504
Filter and search everything the scanner has seen

00:00:21.504 --> 00:00:29.646
Every point is explained: spoofed sender, fake domain, disguised link

00:00:29.646 --> 00:00:32.166
Critical emails get an incident report automatically

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:40.654
HTML and PDF reports, with every indicator defanged

00:00:44.001 --> 00:00:51.114
Unknown attachments go to the sandbox only with your approval

00:00:51.114 --> 00:00:55.444
Or drop in any saved .eml to check it on demand

00:00:55.444 --> 00:00:58.811
A verdict in seconds, with the reasons
